/*
  WidgetSettingsModal.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0027 · WidgetSettingsModal (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `WidgetSettingsModal`
  resolves (table "WidgetSettingsModal") lives here with its English value. The web source
  (features/dashboard/components/WidgetSettingsModal.tsx) routes its copy through
  `t('dashboard.settings…')` / `t('common…')`; the native surface mirrors those keys so no English
  literal lives in Swift. The native-only chrome (dialog title, load / empty / error states, freshness
  chip + banners) uses `widgetSettings.*` keys. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so
  each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Groups: the web-parity section + option labels (`dashboard.settings.*`); the shared footer actions
  (`common.*`); and the native dialog chrome + states (`widgetSettings.*`).
*/

